Changelog: 07-11-2026 20:23:23

Added. The shadPS4 line under the pills says only the state, in the words every manager uses (owner, 07-11-2026): "Not
installed." with "Install it with the Install button." under it, or "Installed." with "Uninstall with the Uninstall
button." under it. The version installed, what Install takes, another version than the app brings, and a newer shadPS4
are in the line's tooltip; another version and a newer shadPS4 also go to the log, once.

